                    "line": 107,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ender",
                        "email": "andhsieh@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "Ender-Hsieh"
                    },
                    "message": "Swallowing all ec values silently hides real D-Bus failures\n(io_error, permission, etc). Per bmcweb convention, only EBADR /\nio_error should be silent (= no association); other ec should\nBMCWEB_LOG_ERROR + messages::internalError"
                },
                {
